<title>USA: Cumberland SD, Wis., won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Cumberland SD, Wis., won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik, Stephens &amp; Thompson, Inc. said it won $8.500 million of Cumberland SD, Wis., general obligation refunding bonds, Series 1996 A, with a true interest cost of 5.51 percent.</p>
</text>
